+ * flags are those of Linux's include/uapi/linux/v4l2-controls.h, by way of
+ * Raspberry Pi's FFmpeg (libavcodec/hevc-ctrls-v4.h); only the HEVC part
+ * is kept, with plain C types so the same layout builds on Linux and on
+ * RISC OS (GCCSDK). Part of riscos-reelhwaccel (hevcdec/).
